The model.config, generated model.sdf and materials/textures/wood.jpg are
unmodified upstream files. Their SHA-256 hashes are listed in SOURCES.json.
The upstream README declares the repository Apache-2.0; no separate texture
license is present, and its original artist has not been independently verified.

This project composes the model with Gazebo Harmonic's standard Physics system
and separate test probes in models/gazebo_rmua19.sdf. The original Fortress
world, xmacro generator and robot/control/referee stack are not imported.
This historical community model is not a validated current competition field.
